stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Draft: Owner copies template
    Draft --> Approved: Reviewer checks definition of ready
    Approved --> Draft: Not ready, sent back
    Approved --> InProgress: Delegate picks it up
    InProgress --> InValidation: Tests pass, implementation notes filled in
    InValidation --> InProgress: Owner updates task, asks for another iteration
    InValidation --> Done: Owner commits, opens PR, CI/CD green
    Done --> [*]

    InProgress: In progress (Delegate, Copilot credits spent here)
    InValidation: In validation (Owner, no credits)
    Draft: Draft (Owner, no credits)
    Approved: Approved (Reviewer, no credits)
    Done: Done (merged)
